1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,180
Ask anything about your health, and get answers from your own records.

2
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:09,540
Maccabi Online shows your records one page at a time.

3
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:14,790
Your whole history, and a genius friend who’s read all of it.

4
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:19,380
Log in as usual, click the icon, and press Start export.

5
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:24,520
It goes through every section on its own, and collects everything the site has.

6
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:30,200
Sped up here. The real thing takes five to twenty minutes.

7
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:34,530
When it’s done, one dated ZIP lands in your Downloads folder.

8
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:38,710
Everything in one place, your full medical file included.

9
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:42,650
It’s yours to keep, and to add to as you go.

10
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:49,200
Open it in the Claude or ChatGPT desktop app, and ask anything.

11
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:56,450
Every answer names its source. You and your doctor decide.

12
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:02,050
Health Records Export for Maccabi. Free, on the Chrome Web Store.
